OL,3,GNEWSAProtesters call for London
OL,4,Arobotaxi trials to stop
OL,5,
OL,6,FDemonstrators have called for trials of
OL,7,Fdriverless taxis in London to be
OL,8,Fstopped, raising concerns about safety,
OL,9,Fcongestion and the impact on jobs.
OL,11,FAbout 15 people protested outside the
OL,12,Foffices of autonomous vehicle company
OL,13,FWayve in King's Cross, which is
OL,14,Ftrialling vehicles in the capital with
OL,15,Fhuman safety operators on board.
OL,17,FAbdurzak Hadi, a private hire driver
OL,18,Fand member of the App Drivers and
OL,19,FCouriers Union (ADCU), said he was
OL,20,F"worried that I'll be forced to compete
OL,21,Fwith a machine that can work 24 hours".
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
