OL,3,GNEWSAProtesters call for London
OL,4,Arobotaxi trials to stop
OL,5,
OL,6,FWayve said it was taking a phased
OL,7,Fapproach to developing the technology
OL,8,Fwith Uber and working with Transport
OL,9,Ffor London (TfL) to ensure future
OL,10,Fservices were introduced responsibly.
